{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgMbzPR6rjhxhcL57RUpE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I haven't changed the Dockerfile because I can only read and search files here, not write them. Here's the fix to paste in.\n\n**Current `Dockerfile`:**\n```dockerfile\nFROM python:3.13-slim\nWORKDIR /app\nCOPY . .\nRUN pip install --no-cache-dir -r requirements.txt\nCMD [\"python\", \"-m\", \"app\"]\n```\n\nNo `USER` is set, so the app runs as root.\n\n**Replacement:**\n```dockerfile\nFROM python:3.13-slim\n\nRUN groupadd --system --gid 10001 app \\\n && useradd --system --uid 10001 --gid app --no-create-home --shell /usr/sbin/nologin app\n\nWORKDIR /app\n\nCOPY requirements.txt .\nRUN pip install --no-cache-dir -r requirements.txt\n\nCOPY . .\n\nUSER 10001:10001\nCMD [\"python\", \"-m\", \"app\"]\n```\n\nWhat changed:\n- **A dedicated system user (`app`, UID/GID 10001)** with no home directory and no login shell.\n- **`USER 10001:10001` comes after the install steps.** Packages still install system-wide as root, but the app itself runs unprivileged. Using the numeric ID lets Kubernetes `runAsNonRoot` confirm it's not root.\n- **The app's files stay owned by root.** I didn't use `COPY --chown`, so the app user can read its code but can't change it at runtime. If the app needs to write somewhere, add a specific directory for that, e.g. `RUN mkdir /app/data && chown app:app /app/data`.\n- **`requirements.txt` is copied first, separately.** This isn't part of the root fix, but code changes no longer force the dependency layer to rebuild.\n\nThings to check:\n- If the app listens on a port below 1024 (e.g. 80), it won't be able to bind it as non-root. Move it to a higher port like 8000 or 8080.\n- A `.dockerignore` file excluding `.git`, `.env` and similar would stop `COPY . .` from putting secrets in the image. I didn't look for one.\n\nI haven't built or run this image. Once you've applied it, `docker run --rm <image> id` should report `uid=10001`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":315,"cache_read_input_tokens":12339,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":315},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"21c798be-77ce-4a7a-989e-f2352ce61a05","uuid":"f51aa102-81c9-47e0-b03d-4672e9342453","timestamp":"2026-10-24T19:20:44.656Z","request_id":"req_011CgMbzP9UczCPs6pZaTSnP"}
